---
description: Coding conventions for ts files
globs: **/*.ts,**/*.tsx,**/*.js,**/*.jsx
alwaysApply: false
---

Before writing or reviewing ts code, read `docs/conventions/ts.md`
and the five pack files it links under `docs/conventions/ts/` and
`docs/conventions/common/`. If `docs/conventions/ts.local.md` exists it
overrides them all. Where any of them conflicts with the repo's existing
dominant style, the repo wins locally — record the conflict as a finding in
the PR.
